{"author":"John Wesley","book":"Notes on the Bible","chapter":1047,"classification":{"bucket":"Christian Classics / Commentaries","canonicalStatus":"noncanonical","contentKind":"commentary","cautionReason":"","doctrinalStatus":"historical","labels":["christian-classics","commentaries"],"severity":0},"id":"classics:wesley:Jer.43","lineage":[],"metadata":{"author":"John Wesley","authorshipDateRange":"18th century","genre":"Commentaries","tradition":"Methodist","translator":null,"edition":"CCEL edition; source omits 2 Samuel 24","rights":"Public Domain","source":{"id":"wesley","provider":"CCEL","sourceUrl":"https://www.ccel.org/ccel/wesley/notes.html","title":"Notes on the Bible"}},"originalBook":"Jeremiah","sourceVolumeId":"wesley","source":{"id":"wesley","sourceUrl":"https://www.ccel.org/ccel/wesley/notes.html","title":"Notes on the Bible"},"title":"Jeremiah 43","reference":"Jeremiah 43","notes":[],"verses":[{"verse":1,"text":"Johanan and the commanders discredit Jeremiah's prophecy, ver."},{"verse":2,"text":"1-3. and with the people, carry him and Baruch into Egypt, ver."},{"verse":3,"text":"4-7."},{"verse":4,"text":"He prophesies by a type, the conquest of Egypt by the Babylonians, ver."},{"verse":5,"text":"8-13."},{"verse":6,"text":"7.","scriptureVerseStart":7,"scriptureVerseEnd":7},{"verse":7,"text":"Tahpanhes - It was at this time the place where the king of Egypt made his residence.","scriptureVerseStart":7,"scriptureVerseEnd":7},{"verse":8,"text":"12.","scriptureVerseStart":12,"scriptureVerseEnd":12},{"verse":9,"text":"Carry them - He shall carry away both the idols, and the inhabitants of Egypt captive.","scriptureVerseStart":12,"scriptureVerseEnd":12},{"verse":10,"text":"With the land - With the spoils of the land of Egypt, he shall clothe his army.","scriptureVerseStart":12,"scriptureVerseEnd":12},{"verse":11,"text":"13.","scriptureVerseStart":13,"scriptureVerseEnd":13},{"verse":12,"text":"Beth-shemesh - Beth-shemesh is the name of a city, which had its name from a famous temple of the sun.","scriptureVerseStart":13,"scriptureVerseEnd":13}],"scriptureReference":{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":43}}